{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"29356c63797cb669","type":"group","x":0,"y":260,"width":4720,"height":250,"label":"HR Admin","color":"6"},
		{"id":"9fe83f8c4799c663","type":"text","x":20,"y":295,"width":160,"height":180,"text":"### HR Admin","color":"6"},
		{"id":"b72115f4ac9cec13","type":"group","x":0,"y":530,"width":4720,"height":250,"label":"HR Staff","color":"5"},
		{"id":"2f93536311ad1c59","type":"text","x":20,"y":565,"width":160,"height":180,"text":"### HR Staff","color":"5"},
		{"id":"ed59c6777b99a955","type":"group","x":0,"y":800,"width":4720,"height":250,"label":"System (automatic)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a38c540006b0b361","type":"text","x":20,"y":835,"width":160,"height":180,"text":"### System (automatic)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"dc288eee54bddb24","type":"group","x":0,"y":1070,"width":4720,"height":250,"label":"Department Head (In-Charge)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"67b3e72f040bf63a","type":"text","x":20,"y":1105,"width":160,"height":180,"text":"### Department Head (In-Charge)","color":"2"},
		{"id":"5f1a8cf25bc85e83","type":"group","x":0,"y":1340,"width":4720,"height":250,"label":"Employee","color":"3"},
		{"id":"ba9be6132546f354","type":"text","x":20,"y":1375,"width":160,"height":180,"text":"### Employee","color":"3"},
		{"id":"efe00ec34b3e908b","type":"group","x":0,"y":1670,"width":2060,"height":440,"label":"DTR status lifecycle"},
		{"id":"e568761191f82ade","type":"text","x":0,"y":-120,"width":1100,"height":200,"text":"# CVSU DTR — HR End-to-End Process Flow\n\nOne monthly DTR cycle, from semester setup to a received, signed DTR. Swimlanes show **who** does each step; numbers show the **order**.\nRed arrows = return / correction loops. Source: [[CVSU-DTR/v3/BUSINESS-RULES|BUSINESS-RULES]] · [[CVSU-DTR/v3/ARCHITECTURE|ARCHITECTURE]]"},
		{"id":"b8aa4a1c0a2f8855","type":"text","x":1140,"y":-120,"width":620,"height":200,"text":"### Legend\n🟪 HR Admin · 🟦 HR Staff · 🟩 System\n🟧 Department Head · 🟨 Employee\n◆ = decision · grey arrow = normal flow · red arrow = loop back"},
		{"id":"c19f73cb8f93fabc","type":"text","x":225,"y":150,"width":590,"height":80,"text":"## ① Semester & period setup"},
		{"id":"3a1c853246ed46e1","type":"text","x":865,"y":150,"width":590,"height":80,"text":"## ② Import attendance"},
		{"id":"b986b038aa38b411","type":"text","x":1505,"y":150,"width":910,"height":80,"text":"## ③ Process & correct"},
		{"id":"38003848fe510e00","type":"text","x":2465,"y":150,"width":910,"height":80,"text":"## ④ Generate & review DTR"},
		{"id":"4f208b62d5b3bd40","type":"text","x":3425,"y":150,"width":590,"height":80,"text":"## ⑤ Finalize, print & sign"},
		{"id":"6d93b1d1c2b5985e","type":"text","x":4065,"y":150,"width":590,"height":80,"text":"## ⑥ Receive, close & report"},
		{"id":"7ad66e2fdeb100c3","type":"text","x":225,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**1. Set up semester**\nAcademic year → semester → monthly DTR periods\nCalendar: holidays & suspensions\nPublish rule set (hours, grace…)","color":"6"},
		{"id":"d84c739087935213","type":"text","x":225,"y":1375,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**2. Submit schedule**\nPick a template or enter time blocks\n`DRAFT → SUBMITTED`","color":"3"},
		{"id":"3173c3894882fcc1","type":"text","x":545,"y":1105,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**3. Approve schedule**\n`SUBMITTED → APPROVED`\nor reject with reason\nOnly approved schedules count","color":"2"},
		{"id":"8c8fa87fecba2eb3","type":"text","x":545,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**4. Open DTR period**\ne.g. *October 2026*\n`DRAFT → OPEN`","color":"6"},
		{"id":"6e2f439a140a9330","type":"text","x":865,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**5. Export & upload**\nExport XLSX/CSV from MB20\nUpload + choose device\n(overlapping files OK)","color":"5"},
		{"id":"ddf205e0c4af2926","type":"text","x":865,"y":835,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**6. Validate file**\nFormat, size, row checks\nDetect duplicates & unmatched IDs\n`VALIDATED` / `REJECTED`","color":"4"},
		{"id":"50bd2f2c8b955247","type":"text","x":1185,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**7. Review errors & commit**\nSummary: new vs already-imported punches\n`VALIDATED → COMMITTED`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"4f474a1b8d788255","type":"text","x":1185,"y":835,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**8. Store raw punches**\nAppend-only evidence\nNo duplicates (device + ID + time)","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a13d19ccd5504501","type":"text","x":1505,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**9. Map unmatched biometric IDs**\nLink device ID → employee\nRaw punches are never edited","color":"5"},
		{"id":"314558e743b5d8c2","type":"text","x":1505,"y":835,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**10. Process DTR period**\nNormalize → AM/PM slots → calendar → exceptions → tardy / undertime\n→ processed attendance","color":"4"},
		{"id":"421cdda40ff85eec","type":"text","x":1825,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**11. Review “Needs Attention”**\n◆ Blocking issues?\nMissing punches · no schedule · pending exceptions","color":"5"},
		{"id":"0fe37fd86ef283a6","type":"text","x":2145,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**12. Record exception**\nLeave · Official Business · time correction · missing-punch certification\nStatus `PENDING`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"c1769b48098dc28d","type":"text","x":2145,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**13. Approve exception**\nMaker-checker: approver ≠ requester\n`PENDING → APPROVED`","color":"6"},
		{"id":"8a003647559c3c3b","type":"text","x":2465,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**14. Generate DTRs (bulk)**\nOne per employee with an approved schedule\n→ `DRAFT`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"d688f883f07c57c9","type":"text","x":2465,"y":835,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**15. Build DTR items**\nCSC Form 48 rows: AM in/out, PM in/out, undertime, remarks","color":"4"},
		{"id":"a42cf67f8edb58ee","type":"text","x":2785,"y":1375,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**16. Review my DTR**\n◆ Correct?\nConfirm → `FOR_REVIEW`\nor *Report a problem*","color":"3"},
		{"id":"18ed64654c1211fe","type":"text","x":3105,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**17. Validate DTR**\n◆ No blocking flags?\n`FOR_REVIEW → VALIDATED`\nor return with reason → `RETURNED`","color":"5"},
		{"id":"e1a7979566072615","type":"text","x":3425,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**18. Finalize DTR**\nFinalizer ≠ validator\n`VALIDATED → FINALIZED`\nDates locked","color":"6"},
		{"id":"40519bcd746c7c2f","type":"text","x":3425,"y":835,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**19. Snapshot + PDF**\nFreeze DTR items\nRender CSC Form 48 PDF\nStore SHA-256 verification code","color":"4"},
		{"id":"0d1f717c873827b2","type":"text","x":3745,"y":1375,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**20. Download, print & sign**\nWet signature\nOptional: *Mark as submitted*\n`FINALIZED → SUBMITTED`","color":"3"},
		{"id":"e7baffc6c511ab8d","type":"text","x":3745,"y":1105,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**21. Sign as In-Charge**\n“Verified as to the prescribed office hours”","color":"2"},
		{"id":"23e94137918f008d","type":"text","x":4065,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**22. Receive signed DTR**\n◆ Complete & signed?\n`→ RECEIVED`\nor reject submission","color":"5"},
		{"id":"8914c0fc856ebf16","type":"text","x":4065,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**23. Reopen DTR (data error)**\nReason required\n`→ DRAFT`, version + 1\nOld PDF kept as superseded","color":"6"},
		{"id":"eb68c6c10251f602","type":"text","x":4385,"y":295,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**24. Close period**\nAll DTRs finalized / received\n`OPEN → CLOSED`","color":"6"},
		{"id":"fb4695b8e8c8b099","type":"text","x":4385,"y":565,"width":270,"height":180,"text":"**25. Reports**\nAttendance summary · tardiness · submission status · import log","color":"5"},
		{"id":"b248de35facc1c1e","type":"text","x":20,"y":1710,"width":160,"height":120,"text":"### DTR status\nOne state machine"},
		{"id":"dee857f76a74e61e","type":"text","x":220,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`DRAFT`**\nsteps 14–15"},
		{"id":"045979259c305afa","type":"text","x":520,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`FOR_REVIEW`**\nstep 16"},
		{"id":"f46b163d4c0460ae","type":"text","x":820,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`VALIDATED`**\nstep 17"},
		{"id":"aa521d0a66a97653","type":"text","x":1120,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`FINALIZED`**\nsteps 18–19","color":"4"},
		{"id":"c74b2ba96fa0d012","type":"text","x":1420,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`SUBMITTED`**\nstep 20"},
		{"id":"22fb4496b3372520","type":"text","x":1720,"y":1730,"width":240,"height":110,"text":"**`RECEIVED`**\nstep 22","color":"4"},
		{"id":"08de798cd7cca4d7","type":"text","x":520,"y":1950,"width":240,"height":120,"text":"**`RETURNED`**\nreason required → regenerate","color":"1"},
		{"id":"d17bd198ce47fcbf","type":"text","x":1420,"y":1950,"width":240,"height":120,"text":"**Reopen** (HR Admin)\nreason required → `DRAFT`, version + 1","color":"1"}
	],
